0.12 0.21 0.28 rg
BT /F2 17 Tf 48 793 Td
(Deployment, Testing and Results) Tj ET
0.16 0.16 0.16 rg
BT /F1 10 Tf 48 764 Td 10.5 TL
(Deployment implementation) Tj T*
(Docker Compose builds two services, exposes the frontend on localhost:3000 and the backend on) Tj T*
(localhost:5001, and stores SQLite in a named volume. Health checks support startup) Tj T*
(coordination. Application liveness does not establish blockchain connectivity. Docker starts) Tj T*
(the web services; contract deployment remains a separate operation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The local deployment script creates a campaign with a 1 ETH goal and a one-hour duration. The) Tj T*
(README also describes Remix and MetaMask deployment to Sepolia, including a 0.002 ETH example) Tj T*
(goal. Public frontend settings are embedded at build time, so changes to address, chain or API) Tj T*
(URL require rebuilding the frontend.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A Render Blueprint defines a Docker frontend and a backend with persistent SQLite storage.) Tj T*
(This is deployment configuration, rather than evidence that hosted services are live. RPC) Tj T*
(credentials belong in backend environment settings. Wallet private keys are unnecessary for) Tj T*
(running either application service.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Testing and Results) Tj T*
(The repository contains automated tests at three levels:) Tj T*
(- Frontend unit tests: precise ETH parsing, invalid amounts, wallet rejection, missing) Tj T*
(wallets, requested network switching and failed network switching.) Tj T*
(- Contract tests: constructor validation, positive contributions, zero-value rejection,) Tj T*
(premature settlement rejection, beneficiary-only withdrawal, deadline enforcement and) Tj T*
(prevention of repeat withdrawals/refunds.) Tj T*
(- Backend tests: authoritative RPC data, database persistence, malformed requests,) Tj T*
(pending/confirmed/failed status transitions, unrelated contract/method rejection, RPC/network) Tj T*
(errors, CORS and configuration checks.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Contract tests use an in-process Ganache EVM. Backend tests use temporary SQLite databases and) Tj T*
(mocked RPC responses. These approaches isolate financial rules and API behavior without) Tj T*
(requiring a deployed Sepolia contract.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Results and evidence boundaries) Tj T*
(Source review confirms that the implementation and these test scenarios exist. No fresh) Tj T*
(pass/fail counts are claimed: test suites, lint and build were not run during preparation of) Tj T*
(this report. The README records an earlier successful production frontend build during Docker) Tj T*
(deployment; this is repository documentation, not a newly reproduced result. Browser/MetaMask) Tj T*
(interaction and Sepolia deployment remain unverified here.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Manual acceptance evidence still needed) Tj T*
(Capture wallet connection, an approved contribution, explorer receipt and history entry. Use) Tj T*
(separate campaigns to demonstrate successful withdrawal and failed-goal refund. Confirm) Tj T*
(unauthorized settlement and repeated claims fail. Restart the backend to check persistence,) Tj T*
(and interrupt history service during a payment to check recovery without a second payment.) Tj T*
(Record desktop/mobile views and invalid-input behavior. No screenshots are fabricated or) Tj T*
(included as observed results.) Tj T*
ET
